1
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:17,970
[Ava] Good morning. Let's review the launch plan. Key point: the beta launch is still on track for October 30, but the payment integration is blocked by the vendor.
[Ava] 早上好。我们来回顾发布计划。关键点：Beta 发布仍按计划在 10 月 30 日进行，但支付集成被供应商阻塞。

2
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:30,960
[Noah] I checked the pricing sheet yesterday. The annual plan is missing two regional prices. Action item: Noah will update the pricing sheet by Wednesday.
[Noah] 我昨天检查了价格表。年度计划缺少两个区域价格。行动项：Noah 将在周三前更新价格表。

3
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:42,750
[Mia] I spoke with three beta customers. They want a simpler onboarding flow. Key point: onboarding is the top usability concern.
[Mia] 我和三位 Beta 客户沟通过了。他们希望有更简单的入驻流程。关键点：入驻流程是最大的可用性问题。

4
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:52,680
[Liam] The revised launch deck is ready for review. Action item: Liam will send the revised launch deck by Friday.
[Liam] 修订后的发布演示文稿已经可以审阅。行动项：Liam 将在周五前发送修订后的发布演示文稿。

5
00:00:54,960 --> 00:01:01,980
[Emma] I can book the customer interview. Action item: Emma will book the customer interview for next Tuesday.
[Emma] 我可以预约客户访谈。行动项：Emma 将在下周二预约客户访谈。

6
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:15,390
[Ava] Decision: we will delay the public beta by one week to finish the payment integration. Risk: the vendor may miss the new deadline, so we need a fallback plan.
[Ava] 决定：我们将公开 Beta 推迟一周，以完成支付集成。风险：供应商可能错过新的截止日期，所以我们需要一个备用方案。

7
00:01:17,670 --> 00:01:25,470
[Noah] I will prepare a fallback pricing option. Action item: Noah will prepare the fallback pricing option by Monday.
[Noah] 我会准备一个备用定价方案。行动项：Noah 将在周一前准备备用定价方案。

8
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:35,130
[Mia] I will draft the new onboarding checklist. Action item: Mia will draft the onboarding checklist by Thursday.
[Mia] 我会起草新的入驻检查清单。行动项：Mia 将在周四前起草入驻检查清单。

9
00:01:37,380 --> 00:01:41,760
[Ava] Great. We will review progress in the next sync on Friday.
[Ava] 很好。我们将在周五的下一次同步会上回顾进展。
